    {
      "id": "3265b57d-464b-44f2-bfad-17b7e0d47ee4",
      "name": "Note 0cd41c",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        140,
        -620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 920,
        "height": 580,
        "content": "## Chase unanswered quotes by SMS, and stop the moment they reply\n\n**Who it is for:** service businesses that send quotes and lose jobs to silence. Plumbers, HVAC, roofers, cleaners, contractors.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Post a quote to the webhook with a phone, name, amount, job and an optional quote link.\n2. You get a text saying the chase has started.\n3. Up to three nudges go out, by default 2, 5 and 9 days later, each at 10am in your time zone.\n4. Before every nudge it asks Twilio whether the customer has texted your number since the quote went out. If they have, the chase stops and you get told.\n5. If they never reply, you get a text when the chase closes.\n\nThere is no database to set up. Twilio already knows whether they replied.\n\n**Setup steps**\n1. Select your Twilio credential on the five Twilio nodes and the three reply checks.\n2. Fill in **Your settings**: business name, your Twilio number, your cell, your time zone. Edit the nudge wording if you like.\n3. Activate the workflow and POST to the production URL of **Quote sent**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "fa2e9ede-b2ac-4266-92fd-b3da3f0eda30",
      "name": "Note 10ff86",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        140,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "### 1. Receive the quote\nAnswers the webhook straight away, then runs the chase in the background. A missing or bad phone number stops it here."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e2e0a71c-224d-4990-9568-ccdff604ad71",
      "name": "Note d925a7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1240,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 2860,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "### 2. Wait, check, nudge\nThree rounds. Each one waits until 10am on the day, asks Twilio for any text from the customer since the quote went out, and only sends a nudge if there is none."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0377d288-9ecd-4124-943e-301fc99651d9",
